---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Micro-Enterprise Loans in Egypt | Community Transformation Trust" description="CT Trust helps provide micro-enterprise loans to women in Egypt through partner GHNI, funding businesses, independence, and a 100% repayment rate.">
  <div class="report-banner-wrap">
    <img class="report-banner" src="/images/funding.png" alt="" loading="eager" />
  </div>
  <article class="wrap report-article">
    <h1>Micro-Enterprise Loans in Egypt</h1>
    <div class="detail-meta"><span>Ongoing</span><span>Egypt</span></div>
    <p class="detail-lead">In Egypt, CT Trust helps provide micro-enterprise loans to women through our partner GHNI &mdash; small but transformative grants that fund businesses, build independence, and, with a 100% repayment rate, create a sustainable cycle of opportunity.</p>

    <section class="reveal">
      <h3>Small loans, lasting independence</h3>
      <p>These grants give women the means to support their families on their own terms, turning a modest amount of capital into a business that lasts.</p>
      <p>With a 100% repayment rate, every loan repaid becomes a loan for the next woman, creating a cycle of opportunity that grows with each business it helps launch.</p>
      <img class="report-photo" src="/images/funding.png" alt="Woman running a micro-enterprise funded by a small loan" loading="lazy" />
    </section>

    <section class="reveal">
      <h3>Why it works</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Small loans unlock disproportionately large change in a family&rsquo;s life.</li>
        <li>A 100% repayment rate keeps the fund sustainable.</li>
        <li>Repaid loans are recycled to support the next entrepreneur.</li>
        <li>Builds independence, dignity, and long-term financial resilience.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="reveal">
      <h3>The lasting difference</h3>
      <p>This is funding that keeps giving. Because loans are repaid and reissued, a single contribution supports one woman after another, building a durable cycle of opportunity across the community.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
